              "value": "The gold dragon breathes in one of two ways. The dragon can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Flame**\n\n- **Traits:** arcane, evocation, fire\n\nThe dragon breathes a blast of flame in a 30-foot cone that deals 11d6 fire damage (31 basic Reflex save).\n- **Weakening Gas**\n\n- **Traits:** arcane, necromancy\n\nThe dragon breathes a blast of weakening gas. Each creature within a 30-foot cone must succeed at a 31 Fortitude save or become enfeebled 1 for 1 minute (or enfeebled 2 on a critical failure)."
